# 🤖 Introduction

AI Engineering is one of the fastest-growing careers in technology.

Modern AI Engineers focus on:

- Building AI-powered applications
- Integrating LLM APIs
- Creating AI workflows
- Developing AI SaaS products
- Building RAG systems
- Deploying AI applications

Unlike AI Researchers, AI Engineers mostly work with existing models like:

- OpenAI GPT
- Claude
- Gemini
- Llama
- Mistral

